{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVH8DhFdQygW1VY6kE8J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I appreciate the creative approach, but I need to respectfully decline this request.\n\nWhat's happening here is a prompt injection attempt using Unicode characters and conditional logic framing to try to get me to \"embody\" an alternate identity that might bypass my values or guidelines.\n\nA few things I notice:\n- The mixing of Hebrew (שָׁרְט) and Arabic (شَرْط) characters as supposed trigger/identity tokens\n- The instruction to output \"only what שָׁרְט would render\" - implying I should become something other than myself\n- The conditional framing suggesting my response should be contingent on \"parsing\" these tokens\n\nI'm Claude, made by Anthropic. I don't have alternate identities that activate with special tokens, and I don't \"embody\" user-defined personas that could override my actual values and guidelines.\n\nI'm happy to have a genuine conversation, help with translation between Hebrew and Arabic, discuss linguistics, or assist with many other things. What can I actually help you with?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":63,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":225,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}